{"id":"2093017842","kind":"answer","title":"教育部表示「义务教育学校不得以任何名义设置重点班」，会带来哪些影响？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"我永远不会送我的孩子去学校","date":"2021-08-30","updated":"2021-08-30","votes":19,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":488,"keywords":["学习动机","自主学习","教育改革","非学校教育","自由学习"],"summary":"没有分班，老师该如何设置授课的难度水平呢？ 知识的多样化导致课堂推动区 [1] 净效应的多样化 在一个典型的教室里，有天赋的学生放慢速度，一些孩子受益，一大群学生进入倒退区 [1] 为了将多样化的负面影响降到最低，学校越来越严格地收紧标准基准，以使进步同质化 对进步的约束加剧了青少年学生对学校教育的普遍憎恨 [2] 学校把天赋…","question_detail_html":"<p>今天（8月30日），教育部召开新闻发布会，介绍秋季学期中小学教育教学工作情况。目前，除个别地方暂缓开学外，全国绝大部分地区中小学、幼儿园将于9月1号安全正常开学。同时，今年秋季学期是中小学全面落实“双减”有关部署要求的第一个学期，教育部要求，要下大力气做强做优校内教育，切实做到教师应教尽教、学生学足学好。</p><p>会上通报，新学期开学后，义务教育学校要严格执行均衡编班的法律规定，<b>不得以任何名义设置重点班</b>，切实做到均衡配置师资。严格执行教学计划，不得随意增减课时、改变难度、调整进度，不得利用课后服务时间讲新课。严格执行作业管理规定，严禁给家长布置或变相布置作业，严禁要求家长检查、批改作业，杜绝重复性、惩罚性作业，不得要求学生自批自改作业。严格执行考试管理规定，不得违规组织考试，考试结果不排名、不公布并以适当方式告知家长和学生，不得按考试结果给学生调整分班、排座位、“贴标签”。</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-63c82c1710d6971d51d235a600e3a526_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"200\" data-image-width=\"200\" href=\"http://m.news.cctv.com/2021/08/30/ARTIW283Bfqd7kpxY1Ygp3Wu210830.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">教育部：不得以任何名义设置重点班</a><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/483445239/answer/2093017842","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"iohsJFAr\">没有分班，老师该如何设置授课的难度水平呢？</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-cea438dbe832936fb4350a4d71df9118_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b76b3f7a93776e4ae281d8fe98f5367d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-b76b3f7a93776e4ae281d8fe98f5367d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-cea438dbe832936fb4350a4d71df9118_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b76b3f7a93776e4ae281d8fe98f5367d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b76b3f7a93776e4ae281d8fe98f5367d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><ul><li data-pid=\"rY4fekg6\">知识的多样化导致课堂推动区<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>净效应的多样化</li><li data-pid=\"PxGj0I2L\">在一个典型的教室里，有天赋的学生放慢速度，一些孩子受益，一大群学生进入倒退区<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"LMhTwFj9\">为了将多样化的负面影响降到最低，学校越来越严格地收紧标准基准，以使进步同质化</li><li data-pid=\"w7HdQ6r9\">对进步的约束加剧了青少年学生对学校教育的普遍憎恨<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"XYg09oPH\">学校把天赋异禀的学生都归功于自己，并将糟糕的结果归咎于那些在考试中得分较低的学生努力不够</li><li data-pid=\"y08MftKm\">通过关注天才的成功，学校没有意识到系统的失败程度</li></ul><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b7c05e3af1b2094580d34d6596c6de80_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"861\" data-image-width=\"1621\" data-tm-id=\"347510057\" href=\"#/post/347510057\">叶峻峣：课堂教学的内在问题</a><p data-pid=\"D0bbMRBO\">当然，这个问题就算分班，也难以解决，真正解决方法应当是自由学习：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-d5f3952aa94dfd9ab03604e144f30560_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0e0d30816aa890b76069f01c930d80b8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0e0d30816aa890b76069f01c930d80b8_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-d5f3952aa94dfd9ab03604e144f30560_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0e0d30816aa890b76069f01c930d80b8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-0e0d30816aa890b76069f01c930d80b8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"sqspCVtj\">然而自由学习又会遇到基准不统一的问题，即自由学习者可能无法通过学校的标准，但是在他自己学习的领域，却能超过大多数人。</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6b0c6d48d34f1e4d4ae44e8b3b7842b2_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"499\" data-image-width=\"750\" data-tm-id=\"272543239\" href=\"#/post/272543239\">叶峻峣：自由学习</a><p data-pid=\"cTKciyQ3\">所以，实际上我们需要的是文化范式的转变：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"_0C64ki1\">诱惑总是存在的：我们想要一个聪明的劳动力，我们想要一个聪明的社会，因此增加更多的材料和提高标准从来没有被认为是一件坏事。它必须改变，并且需要文化范式的转变。</blockquote><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-cf977a87fd02e754308f2efb72562668_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"722\" data-image-width=\"1897\" data-tm-id=\"242815901\" href=\"#/post/242815901\">叶峻峣：教育改革</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 最佳推动区 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"67694020\" href=\"#/post/67694020\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 为什么孩子们讨厌学校？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"70779863\" href=\"#/post/70779863\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"242815901","title":"教育改革","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":265,"minutes":30,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"70779863","title":"20 孩子们为什么讨厌学校？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":9,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"67694020","title":"11 最佳推动区","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":18,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"272543239","title":"自由学习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":299,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"},{"id":"347510057","title":"课堂教学的内在问题","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":65,"minutes":8,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"52805512","title":"1 前言","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"66683201","title":"21 登山比喻","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":51,"minutes":9,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"67390960","title":"9 毒性记忆","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":227,"minutes":24,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"65338937","title":"10 为什么学校会失败？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":33,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2147695256","title":"如何看待中国教育体制？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":45,"minutes":9,"reason":"相似问答 · 45 赞同"},{"id":"1701028559","title":"如何看待衡水二中学生反映学校寒假期间「要求高一学生早五晚十学习，开摄像头监控」，是否涉嫌侵犯学生权益?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":968,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 968 赞同"},{"id":"1789118480","title":"如何看待六部门印发指南「义务教育阶段不分重点班快慢班」？会带来哪些影响？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":9,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 9 赞同"},{"id":"2494734252","title":"一学霸说「我考上清华北大关学校什么事？」这句话合理吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":380,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 380 赞同"},{"id":"1709646861","title":"如何看待教育部「中小学生不得带手机入校，学校不得用手机布置作业」这一通知？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":45,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 45 赞同"}]}